10. Increase the metaspace size

Replace the below line in setenv.sh inside tomcat bin

CATALINA_OPTS="$CATALINA_OPTS -Dfile.encoding=UTF-8 -Djava.locale.providers=JRE,COMPAT,CLDR -Djava.net.preferIPv4Stack=true -Duser.timezone=GMT -Xss8m -Xms8g -Xmx20g -XX:MaxNewSize=5g -XX:MaxMetaspaceSize=5g -XX:MetaspaceSize=3g -XX:NewSize=3g -XX:SurvivorRatio=7"







