13. For Lucene Advanced Search:

a)    Download and rename src from github :
wget https://github.com/rnewson/couchdb-lucene/archive/v2.1.0.tar.gz -O couchdb-lucene.tar.gz
b)    Extract src
tar -xzf couchdb-lucene.tar.gz
c)    cd couchdb-lucene-2.1.0
d)    sed -i "s/allowLeadingWildcard=false/allowLeadingWildcard=true/" ./src/main/resources/couchdb-lucene.ini
e)    Edit and make changes to couchdb-lucene.ini for couchdb username and pwd (username and passward given while installing)
vim ./src/main/resources/couchdb-lucene.ini
http://username:pwd@localhost:5984/
f)    Download patch
wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sw360/sw360vagrant/master/shared/couchdb-lucene.patch
g)    Apply patch
patch -p1 < couchdb-lucene.patch
h)    Build sources
mvn clean install war:war
i)    Copy and rename war file to webapps
cp ./target/*.war /<liferay>/<tomcat>/webapps/couchdb-lucene.war




